WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:06.330
I'd have to forge new armor especially for them.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:08.250
Would you?

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.960
That I can do.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:15.170
There's just one problem...

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:52.420
Brushing things off with a "whatever"

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:55.540
Stuck later in an unchanging life

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:57.790
The whatevers became habit

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:01.040
My skills still have yet to bloom

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:06.040
If I don't try to win and but am unwilling to lose

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:11.710
Why does this cold heart still beat with time?

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:18.000
All of us are monsters with hidden powers

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.580
Are we going to live without awakening them?

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:26.880
We push things down and cover them up

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:29.750
And our hearts are fresh no more

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:34.500
But we're monsters who continue on without so much as a face

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:40.920
All of us have undiscovered powers hidden inside

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:44.790
You're up next

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:50.500
Stand and face it monster

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.040
There's a problem?

00:01:56.330 --> 00:02:01.380
Mhm. I can fix up some armor,
but not with the materials we have here.

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:03.880
Your friends here are too strong.

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:08.040
They are? A bunch of slimes and a Proud Wolf?

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:12.080
Sure, they don't seem like much
when you view them apart.

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:15.710
But together as one with their tamer...

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:21.040
I've never seen stronger monsters
than those here with you now.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.130
That so?

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:28.670
Guess armor is out of the question, then.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:33.330
No, we just need materials strong enough to suit them.

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:39.210
This here's a Lesser Fire Dragon jewel.

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:43.040
The very best stuff you'll find on the market.

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:46.630
You can get them from defeating Lesser Fire Dragons.

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:51.330
So the better the material,
the better the armor. Makes sense.

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:58.830
But even if I used these, the armor would hardly hold up
under the strength of your monsters.

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.460
So you need something stronger?

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:02.710
Exactly.

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:07.540
There's a special breed of these dragons
known as the Blue Lesser Fire Dragons.

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:10.500
Get a jewel from one of those and it might hold up.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:13.040
Blue Lesser Fire Dragons...

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:16.170
And I'd find some up there?

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:20.920
That mountain is crawling with Lesser Fire Dragons.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:25.420
They're rare, but every now and again
there's a Blue one among 'em.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:30.630
It won't be easy finding one, though.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:36.830
Won't be easy to find or take down.

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:43.960
When our veteran Lesser Fire Dragon
hunting groups go down, it's usually to a Blue.

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:46.130
Sounds like this won't be easy, then.

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:53.670
You'll have your work cut out for you, but get me a jewel
from a Blue and I'll fix you up something special.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:55.250
I'll get to it.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:00.880
Tell me though, if there are Lesser Fire Dragons...

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:04.000
...does that mean there are normal Fire Dragons, too?

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:07.380
Well, yeah, but...

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:13.500
Never heard of anyone taking one down in all my years.

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:18.040
No, huh? Guess I'll look for that Blue Lesser, then.

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:22.500
I'll be here, but I won't hold my breath.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.710
I'd like to take on these requests.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:32.000
Umm... all of them?

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:38.380
If I'm going to look into these monsters,
I might as well take on requests for them.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.790
You're looking to take down Lesser Fire Dragons, I see.

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:43.830
I feel you might be looking to tackle a few too many...

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:46.500
It's fine. I'll use magic or something.

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:50.920
Huh? Magic doesn't work
on Lesser Fire Dragons, though.

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:57.500
Lesser Fire Dragons are graced
with magical protection by their jewels.

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:01.580
Their tough scales make them resilient
against ordinary attacks, too.

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:04.750
They sound like a pain.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:07.040
How do people usually defeat them?

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:10.040
Using water, more often than not.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:15.040
Lesser Fire Dragons are so weak to water
that a few dozen liters can take one down.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:20.790
Carrying the water up the mountain
is no simple feat, however.

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.170
Why not just use water magic?

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:28.250
One would need incredible magic reserves
to conjure up all that water!

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:30.630
No one can use magic like that.

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:32.880
Water magic is sort of my specialty.

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:41.330
E-even still, you'd have to cross the river
to get to the mountain, anyway.

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:42.500
What river?

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:48.000
A river home to the vicious, man-eating fish, the Piranha.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:53.920
You risk being dragged to the bottom of the river
if it gets its teeth into you.

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:56.960
I'll take that request, too, then.

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:58.960
Do you understand these words I'm speaking?!

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:06.040
Wow, that's some mountain.

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:08.130
Clearly still an active volcano.

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:12.670
Is it even safe to get any closer?

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:14.670
We'll go ask!

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:15.920
You wait there!

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:18.960
Ask who...?

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:26.000
Is that thing a slime, too?

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.210
Beats me...

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:34.460
<b>Monster</b>

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:34.460
<b>Red Slime</b>

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:34.460
<b>Tamed</b>

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:34.130
"Red Slime." Guess there are other types.

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:37.830
Yuji! They say it's fine!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:41.080
The volcano is safe this day!

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:48.670
This must be the river with the Piranha.

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:51.380
She said it'd be swimming at the surface, but...

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:53.920
Is this where it lives?

00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:55.880
Yup! Sure is!

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:58.080
Any signs of anything?

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:02.460
I can't really tell with all this water...

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:09.250
If I can't use the slimes to sense anything,
I guess we'll need to check below the surface...

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:12.170
But can you guys even swim?

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.540
Nope!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.710
I'll have to try something.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.670
Magic Maker! Slime Net!

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:41.960
Not seeing much.

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:44.830
It's dark and scary down here...

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:47.000
Stay alert, fellow slimes.

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:50.750
Found something!

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.500
Think I'll hop on in.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:54.580
Careful down there.

00:07:57.630 --> 00:08:00.130
Hey! You okay down there?

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:01.580
Find anything?

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.000
I'll go check, too!

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:16.790
Yuji, I guess there's nothing down here.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:41.420
Yuji, pull us up!

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.710
That's the Piranha!

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:54.670
And here it comes!

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:56.130
<b>Area of Effect</b>

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:56.380
<b>Area of Effect</b>

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:56.380
<b>Ice Magic</b>

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:57.630
Ranged Frost - Medium!

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:56.500
<b>Ice Magic</b>

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:56.880
<b>Area of Effect</b>

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:56.880
<b>Ice Magic</b>

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:03.540
Hooray!

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:05.460
Okay, that's one mission down.

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:13.000
Yuji! That things back for more!

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:17.380
Spell Transfer - Fireball!

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:24.670
Wow, that was cool!

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:26.830
It's not coming back from that, right?

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:39.790
What's a volcano like?

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:40.710
Are there any hot springs?

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:42.040
Are the veggies yummy?

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.380
I'm hungry!

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:46.040
Since when did I have this many?

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:53.670
Monsters, huh? Usually my slimes would alert me.

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.670
Hey, what are those?

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:02.790
Dragons!

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:04.750
And so many of them!

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:06.540
Over there, too!

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:10.540
Yuji! We found 'em! These are all Lesser Fire Dragons!

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:14.380
Okay, let's do this.

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:20.920
What's the matter?

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:25.790
Mom always said Lesser Fire Dragons are scary...

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:31.630
Slimes have moms?

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:39.250
I guess these dragons are some sort
of big deal for these slimes.

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:40.670
Which means...

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:47.830
Looks like it noticed me.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:50.790
Time to give it a try.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:52.290
Water Cannon!

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:04.580
Looks like ordinary old water really does the trick.

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:08.330
Maybe these things need to stay super-heated to survive.

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:19.830
I take it this is the jewel?

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:28.790
Doesn't look all that scary.

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:29.880
Maybe we'll be fine.

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:31.130
We could have done that.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:34.210
We can do this!

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.580
Bring it!

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:37.500
Who's scared now?!

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.750
Let's go, Yuji!

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:43.080
Let us fight the Lesser Fire Dragons together!

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:44.750
Let's beat 'em up!

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:48.210
Good grief.

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:50.920
Spell Transfer - Water Cannon.

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:57.500
Huzzah! We've done it!

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:59.210
Yay!

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:02.290
They're almost TOO weak to water.

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:05.250
This would get patched out in a video game.

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:07.630
Yuji! Yuji!

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:09.540
We found a blue one!

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:24.670
Well, now.

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:27.460
It sure looks tougher
than those other Lesser Fire Dragons.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:32.880
And judging by those blue scales,
I'd wager this is the one we're after.

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:37.420
Slimes, I want ten of you to surround that dragon.

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:38.670
Okay!

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:43.290
Spell Transfer - Water Cannon!

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:52.170
It's working!

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:53.540
Sure is!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.710
But that wasn't enough!

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.630
It's making right for us!

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:04.330
Yuji, help!

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:07.210
Water Cannon alone isn't enough, huh?

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:10.210
Then we just need to use something
that will chill it even more.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:13.250
Ranged Frost - Medium!

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:23.920
Figured that might not be enough.

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:27.290
Slimes, gather in front of that dragon.

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:28.540
Okay!

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:34.630
Spell Transfer - Ranged Frost - Medium - times 10!

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:43.540
Did that do it?

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:09.210
We won, then...?

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:10.460
Did we?

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:11.830
Did we win?

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:14.460
Yay!

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:15.580
We did it!

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.880
This should get us the armor we need.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:28.170
All right, let's take down the rest of
the Lesser Fire Dragons and call it a day.

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:29.880
Okay!

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:31.790
Spell Transfer - Water Cannon!

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:33.210
There's another!

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:33.790
Water Cannon!

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:35.250
And another here!

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:35.250
Water Cannon!

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:36.250
Yuji!

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:39.210
Water Cannon! Water Cannon! Water Cannon!

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.460
There's another one of those blue ones!

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:39.210
Another!

00:14:39.210 --> 00:14:40.460
WATER CANNON!

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:46.290
I'd like to submit these for completion.

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:49.210
A-all of them?

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:53.540
That's 202 Lesser Fire Dragons eliminated?

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:56.500
And the Piranha, too?!

00:14:56.880 --> 00:14:59.710
Yeah, it was hiding, so I lured it out.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:00.880
Huh?

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:07.250
The Piranha should normally swim
near the surface looking for prey...

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:10.380
Well, it was at the bottom of the river.

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:13.790
Thanks for sharing that information.

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:16.540
What's that for?

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:18.080
An emergency investigative survey.

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:22.630
We always send out a survey whenever
any monster shows unusual signs.

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:24.540
Just to be safe.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:28.250
Makes sense...

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:32.420
Are you still open?

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:35.920
Oh, it's the tamer from this morning.

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:39.380
Find yourselves a Blue Lesser Fire Dragon?

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:40.630
We did.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:45.960
That there is a Blue Lesser Fire Dragon jewel?!

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:47.920
You got this all by yourself?!

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:49.750
Me and my monsters, yeah.

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:53.630
You lot are even stronger than I thought.

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:56.000
I just lucked out with the right skills.

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:59.290
You can craft some armor with this now, right?

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:02.170
Sure can. You're in for a real treat.

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:05.080
I take it you want something for Proud Wolf?

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:07.040
Yeah, and...

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:11.130
I've got one more, so can you
make something for a slime, too?

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:14.670
You didn't get one Blue Lesser Fire Dragon jewel...

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:16.790
...but TWO?!

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:21.880
And if you need any regular
Lesser Fire Dragon jewels, then...

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:29.670
Are these all actual jewels?

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:32.130
Of ridiculous quality, too.

00:16:32.460 --> 00:16:35.420
Ridiculous meaning low?

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:37.630
Meaning way too high!
He means way too high!<b></b>

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:39.460
Really?

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:44.210
They're crystal clear without a blemish in sight.

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:48.040
I can fix you up some fine gear with these.

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:49.830
Consider the request made, then.

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:53.710
All right! Let's get straight to work!

00:16:53.710 --> 00:16:55.330
Get that kiln piping hot!

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:56.130
Yessir!

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:58.880
Can't wait to see what they make.

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:05.750
That there's my finest work yet.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:09.920
Though half of that's thanks
to those jewels you brought in.

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:11.500
That's good to hear.

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:13.670
Go on and try 'em out.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:18.130
I-I've never felt so light before!

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:20.040
This is crazy!

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:29.170
Doesn't look like he's struggling at all,
but he's way faster than usual.

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:31.380
Look at this speed!

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:32.580
As our main form of travel, this is good news.

00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:35.040
You're up next.

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:38.130
Yay!

00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:44.630
That thing's fast!

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:46.790
Not bad.

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:48.920
Again, much faster than usual.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.420
Can that armor stand a bit of a magic boost?

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:55.960
An endurance test, huh? Give it a go.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:18:00.000
Stamina Buff! Mobility Boost! Defense Boost!

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:17.880
That was crazy!

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:20.830
Looks like it's in one piece. Should be all set.

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:24.460
Thank you. This was worth the wait.

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:28.460
Hang on now, you've still got more to test, eh?

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:31.920
Don't imagine you just run around in a fight.

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.790
He's sharp.

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:37.710
Slime, come on back this way.

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:38.670
Coming!

00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:41.330
Spell Transfer...

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:44.040
Ranged Frost - Medium!

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:52.670
That slime can use magic?!

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:57.880
Where did that power come from?!

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:03.540
I'd like to keep this a secret if I can.

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:08.880
Seems like it just barely held up to that spell.

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:11.710
You use any more powerful magic than that?

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.790
On occasion.

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:15.790
Would doing so break it?

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:18.080
It well could.

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:23.000
But this is the best I can make
with the materials you brought.

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:26.130
Meaning you could do more with something better?

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:31.630
To make something stronger than this...

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:40.130
A Fire Dragon...

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:46.580
I could do more with a Fire Dragon jewel,
but no one can defeat one of those.

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:48.960
Why not?

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:51.330
One look will show you why.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:57.080
That thing lives deep in the volcano's lava,
but occasionally pokes its head out.

00:19:57.630 --> 00:20:00.080
Its head? That's it?

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:05.420
Mhm. It peaks out, but does nothing else.

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:09.540
So long as no idiot goes up there
pouring water on the thing.

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:15.500
So the Fire Dragon's weak to water, too, then.

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:21.920
What would it do to the volcano
if it came out of the lava, though?

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:32.670
Yuji! They're all going mad up here!

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:35.790
<b>Sense Share</b>

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:42.710
This...

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:45.710
...is just like back in Phastan.

00:20:46.630 --> 00:20:49.540
Another plan is now in the works.

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:53.330
Slimes, Proud Wolf...

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:59.170
Head to the volcano and see if you spot anyone
who looks out of place.

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:00.960
Wh-why, though?

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:03.000
I've got a bad feeling about this...

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:07.880
We have eyes on a pair!

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:41.080
<b>EPISODE 8</b>

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:41.080
<b>WE GOT SOME MONSTER ARMOR</b>

00:21:41.380 --> 00:21:43.710
Time to eat! Da da da dan!

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:46.670
Exploration and procurement are our specialties

00:21:46.670 --> 00:21:48.130
"Be sure to bring lots of friends!"

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:51.920
There's always an encounter one step away from town

00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:53.250
"Agh, I'm starved! My strength is gone!"

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:54.710
"Look at all these tough baddies!"

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:56.080
"This is ridic! Seriously ridic!"

00:21:56.080 --> 00:22:01.290
"Crazy, wild, and super glaring!"

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.380
"Well it seems time we use our secret weapon!"

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:00.000
"Since when do we have one?"

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:02.290
"I say we ruuun!"

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:05.500
But we wound up surrounded

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:10.920
We're about to experience annihilation!

00:22:12.670 --> 00:22:18.790
Brave heroes stand and fight!

00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:20.210
"Firepower boosting potions"

00:22:20.210 --> 00:22:21.290
"The more you chew, the more you get super healed"

00:22:21.290 --> 00:22:24.330
Strength strength coursing through us

00:22:24.330 --> 00:22:27.290
Here's some leaves!

00:22:25.670 --> 00:22:27.290
"Let's take them!"

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:29.630
Time to eat! Da da da dan!

00:22:31.130 --> 00:22:36.130
This food we finally got our hands on is great, huh?

00:22:36.250 --> 00:22:38.880
Whether in caves or in the lost woods,

00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:41.880
Oh we eat our fill from nature's buffet

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:46.920
Can't fight on an empty stomach!

00:22:47.040 --> 00:22:52.080
Let's go, give it a fusion attack! A super strong magical one

00:22:52.170 --> 00:22:55.170
Split the earth and breathe fire!

00:22:55.170 --> 00:22:56.580
"Ultimate super-powered magic!"

00:22:56.580 --> 00:22:57.960
"A jewelry box of magical power and cheats!"

00:22:57.960 --> 00:22:59.380
"Hellfire of Demise will get them all in one go!"

00:22:59.380 --> 00:23:02.170
"That was all in your dreams, right?"

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:04.790
A CHEST!

00:23:02.170 --> 00:23:07.290
Yuji! Yuji! The best! The Sage! Yuji! Yuji! Oooh tame me!

00:23:07.290 --> 00:23:09.630
Time to eat! Da da da dan!

00:23:11.460 --> 00:23:13.960
Time for an isekai preview from us reincarnated slimes!

00:23:15.380 --> 00:23:18.250
With the new armor Yuji got us we're stronger than ever!

00:23:18.420 --> 00:23:19.920
Yay! Hi, everyone!

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:21.250
Hello!

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:22.670
What are you two up to?

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:26.000
We're talking about what all of us
are gonna do with Yuji next!

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:26.920
Neat!

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:28.790
L-l-look out!

00:23:28.790 --> 00:23:29.710
What's the matter?

00:23:29.710 --> 00:23:33.380
No time to hang around!
A ginormous dragon's headed our way!

00:23:34.580 --> 00:23:36.750
"We fought a Fire Dragon."

00:23:35.000 --> 00:23:41.080
<b>WE FOUGHT A FIRE DRAGON</b>

00:23:36.920 --> 00:23:38.920
Time to join Yuji and fight!
